OL,3,AFamily told to call locksmith over
OL,4,Amental health fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe police watchdog has criticised a
OL,7,Fforce after call handlers told a family
OL,8,Fraising mental health concerns to ring
OL,9,Fa locksmith.
OL,11,FOn 6 August 2025, Hobie Harrison's
OL,12,Fparents called Norfolk Police to
OL,13,Frequest a welfare check after he failed
OL,14,Fto respond to them. He was found dead
OL,15,Fthe next day.
OL,17,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,18,FConduct (IOPC) said the force's 101
OL,19,Fcall handlers should have referred the
OL,20,Ffamily to mental health services, but
OL,21,Finstead suggested they contacted a
OL,22,Flocksmith.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
