OL,3,AFamily told to call locksmith over
OL,4,Amental health fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorfolk Police said it was reviewing
OL,7,Fthe findings and it had been following
OL,8,Fthe force's Right Care, Right Person
OL,9,F(RCRP) policy, which limits officer
OL,10,Fattendance at welfare calls to cases
OL,11,Finvolving "immediate risk to life".
